#. i18n: file: prefdialogdata.ui:146
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QRadioButton, m_smallView)
#: rc.cpp:18
msgid ""
"This feature will allow you to make KWeather take up only one slot on the "
"kicker. Normally this application will take up two slots. The small view "
"will only show the weather icon, while the normal view will display both the "
"icon and the current weather statistics. For the small view the weather "
"statistics will be put on the buttons tool tip."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie funksie veroorsaak dat KWeer slegs een gleuf op die "
"Kicker opneem. Gewoonlik sal hierdie program twee gleuwe opneem. Die klein sig sal slegs die weer ikoon vertoon, terwyl die normale sig beide die ikoon en die huidige weer statistieke sal wys. Vir die klein "
"sig sal die weer statistieke op die knoppie se "
"leidraad vertoon word."

